    turnFlow: "1. Each player has a face-down draw pile and a face-up discard pile.\n2. In the center, four foundation piles (one for each suit) are built UPWARDS in suit.\n3. **Turn Action**: You must play cards from your draw/discard pile to the center OR onto an opponent's discard pile (if one rank higher, regardless of suit).\n4. **Forced Play**: If a card CAN be played to a center foundation, it MUST be played before any other move.\n5. **Juse!**: If a player misses a forced play, any other player can shout 'JUSE!'. The offender must take cards from the bottom of every other player's pile.",
